---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Become a Founding Donor"
  description="Founding donors ($1,000+) start the institution: incorporation, 501(c)(3) filing, and the founding board."
>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Become a Founding Donor</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The New Bill of Rights Foundation doesn't formally exist yet — founding
      donors are what start it. A commitment of $1,000 or more funds
      incorporating the foundation, filing for 501(c)(3) status, opening bank
      accounts, establishing the board of directors, and hiring part-time
      support.
    </p>

    <h2>What founding donors receive</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        A seat on the founding <strong>board of directors</strong> for at least
        one year (continuing thereafter if re-appointed).
      </li>
      <li>Membership in the <strong>invite-only online salon series</strong>.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Permanent recognition</strong> as a founding donor on this
        website.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How it works right now</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>No money changes hands today.</strong> Until the entity and its
      bank account exist, we only collect expressions of interest: your name,
      email, intended amount, and anything you'd like us to know. When the
      foundation incorporates (planned for 2026), we'll come back to you before
      any payment.
    </p>

    <p class="form-success" id="donor-success" hidden>
      <strong>Thank you.</strong> Your interest is recorded — we'll be in touch
      personally as incorporation moves forward.
    </p>
    <form
      class="interest"
      method="post"
      action="/api/submit"
      aria-label="Founding donor interest"
      data-success="donor-success"
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="type" value="seed-donor" />
      <input type="hidden" name="source" value="/get-involved/seed-donors" />
      <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="/get-involved/seed-donors?submitted=donor" />
      <input type="hidden" name="startedAt" value="" />
      <p class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
        <label>Leave this field empty<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
      </p>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="name">Name</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required />
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required />
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="amount">Intended amount (USD)</label>
        <input id="amount" name="amount" type="number" min="1000" step="100" placeholder="1000" />
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="note">Anything you'd like us to know (optional)</label>
        <textarea id="note" name="note" rows="4"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit">Express interest</button>
    </form>
    <p>
      Prefer email? Reach us at
      <a href="mailto:contact@newbillofrights.net">contact@newbillofrights.net</a>
      with the subject “Founding donor”.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<script src="../../scripts/form-submit.ts"></script>

<style>
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .interest {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-block: var(--space-3);
  }

  .field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  input,
  textarea {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: inherit;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
  }

  button {
    justify-self: start;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hp {
    position: absolute;
    left: -9999px;
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .form-success {
    background: var(--band);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
